  "project_description": "A backend library plugin for the Charts module that renders charts with the Apache ECharts JavaScript library. It registers an 'echarts' chart Library plugin so any Charts producer (Views, fields, or the Charts render API) can output area, bar, bubble, column, donut, gauge, line, pie, scatter and spline charts using ECharts. Marked experimental. Requires the echarts JS library either installed locally under /libraries or served from the jsDelivr CDN.",
